{"type":"message","id":"3a75ef7c","parentId":"312b1f11","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:27:55.869Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-02-26 19:27 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 请优化 `/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory` 这个 skill。\n\n**优化目标：**\n1. 引入开源 FSRS 算法实现（类似 Anki 的强大间隔重复功能）\n2. 改为服务守护模式：不再使用 openclaw cron 定时提醒，而是作为长期运行的服务，检测是否有卡片到期\n3. 卡片到期时，向 Discord 频道 `1475722914904014958` 发送复习提醒\n\n**参考：**\n- FSRS 算法开源实现：https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/fsrs4anki\n- Skill 设计规范：https://docs.openclaw.ai/tools/skills\n\n**工作流程：**\n1. 先搜索了解 FSRS 算法\n2. 分析当前 skill 实现\n3. 设计新架构（服务守护模式）\n4. 实现优化\n5. 测试验证\n\n请开始执行。"}],"timestamp":1772105275867}}
