{"type":"message","id":"f683133f","parentId":"90c3f3b9","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:28:33.784Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"让我获取当前 skill 的实现细节，以及搜索 FSRS 算法的基本信息。","thinkingSignature":"c01e2d317e131a74c0e00bafb99ded45daefab0287a6342a086371e5b499dba3"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ego2ikmdhafd_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/SKILL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ego2ikmdhafd_2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/README.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ego2ikmdhafd_3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/scripts/"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ego2ikmdhafd_4","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"FSRS spaced repetition algorithm implementation JavaScript","count":5}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":516,"output":163,"cacheRead":7794,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8473,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772105309673}}
{"type":"message","id":"ecb5e0a3","parentId":"f683133f","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:28:33.804Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ego2ikmdhafd_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: fsrs-memory\ndescription: FSRS 间隔重复记忆系统 - 在 Discord 中添加卡片、复习、查看统计\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nmetadata:\n  openclaw:\n    requires:\n      bins: []\nenv: []\nfiles:\n  read:\n    - <WORKSPACE>/IncrementalMemorization/src/storage.js\n    - <WORKSPACE>/IncrementalMemorization/src/scheduler.js\n    - <WORKSPACE>/IncrementalMemorization/src/fsrs.js\n  write:\n    - <WORKSPACE>/IncrementalMemorization/data/cards.db\n---\n\n# FSRS Memory - 间隔重复记忆系统\n\n在 Discord 中管理你的记忆卡片\n\n## 功能\n\n### 添加卡片\n解析消息，格式：`问题::答案` 或 `问题:答案`\n\n示例：\n- `什么是FSRS::间隔重复算法`\n- `Mandarin:普通话`\n- `添加 苹果::Apple`\n\n### 命令列表\n- `列表` 或 `list` - 查看所有卡片\n- `统计` 或 `stats` - 查看学习统计\n- `待复习` 或 `due` - 查看待复习卡片\n- `复习` 或 `review` - 开始复习流程\n- `帮助` 或 `help` - 显示帮助\n\n### 复习流程\n1. 输入 `复习`\n2. 系统显示问题\n3. 回复 1-5 评分：\n   - 1 = 完全忘记\n   - 2 = 记得困难\n   - 3 = 正常回忆\n   - 4 = 容易回忆\n   - 5 = 瞬间记住\n4. 系统自动安排下次复习时间\n\n## 处理流程\n\n1. **解析消息**\n   - 检查是否包含 `::` 或 `:`\n   - 检查是否为命令（列表/统计/复习等）\n\n2. **执行操作**\n   - 添加：调用 storage.addCard()\n   - 列表：调用 storage.getAllCards()\n   - 统计：调用 scheduler.getStats()\n   - 复习：调用 scheduler.getNextCard()\n\n3. **返回结果**\n   - 格式化输出\n   - 返回 Discord 消息\n\n## 示例对话\n\n用户: `添加 什么是API::应用程序接口`\n系统: ✅ 卡片已添加！ (ID: 6)\n\n用户: `列表`\n系统: 📚 共 6 张卡片...\n\n用户: `复习`\n系统: 📝 复习卡片 #2\n   问题: 什么是间隔重复\n   回复 1-5 评分...\n\n用户: `4`\n系统: 😊 Good | 下次复习: 4 天\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772105313801}}
{"type":"message","id":"f8e7bf18","parentId":"ecb5e0a3","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:28:33.810Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ego2ikmdhafd_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# FSRS 记忆系统 - AI 处理参考\n\n当用户在 Discord 发送消息时，使用以下 handler 处理：\n\n```javascript\nconst handler = require('/home/one/ai/skills/fsrs-memory/scripts/handler');\nconst response = handler.handleMessage(userMessage, userId);\nif (response) {\n  // 发送回复\n}\n```\n\n## 常用命令\n- 问题::答案 - 直接添加\n- 添加 问题::答案 - 命令添加\n- 列表 / list - 查看卡片\n- 统计 / stats - 统计\n- 复习 / review - 开始复习\n- 帮助 / help - 帮助\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772105313808}}
