{"type":"message","id":"cc4137b3","parentId":"d452f794","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:28:35.412Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_ego2ikmdhafd_4","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"FSRS spaced repetition algorithm implementation JavaScript\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1564,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c66e69f3478690f3\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGitHub - open-spaced-repetition/fsrs.js: A spaced repetition algorithm which overtakes Anki and catches up with SuperMemo.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c66e69f3478690f3\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/fsrs.js\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"55374571b28ea892\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nconst fsrsJs = require(&quot;fsrs.js&quot;) let fsrs = new fsrsJs.FSRS(); let card = new fsrsJs.Card(); let rating= fsrsJs.Rating; let state = fsrsJs.State; //Set algorithm parameters // fsrs.p.request_retention=0.9 // fsrs.p.maximum_interval=36500 // fsrs.p.w=[0.4, 0.6, 2.4, 5.8, 4.93, 0.94, 0.86, 0.01, 1.49, 0.14, 0.94, 2.18, 0.05, 0.34, 1.26, 0.29, 2.61] console.log(fsrs.p) let now = new Date(2022, 10, 29, 12, 30, 0, 0); let scheduling_cards = fsrs.repeat(card, now); console.log(scheduling_cards);\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"55374571b28ea892\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"github.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7a8495ab76579a3f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSpaced Repetition Anywhere :: jakob.space\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7a8495ab76579a3f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://jakob.space/blog/spaced-repetition-anywhere.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f00ac465f33c5eda\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTreating the algorithm as a black box, I took Fernando Borretti&#x27;s implementation in his article Implementing FSRS in 100 Lines, dumped it into Qwen3-30B-A3B-UD-Q3_K_XL2, and asked it to translate the code to JavaScript.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f00ac465f33c5eda\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"jakob.space\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"13f257a0869bcecc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nRepetition - npm search\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"13f257a0869bcecc\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.npmjs.com/search?q=Repetition\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7a6a1601185fd103\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n<strong>ts-fsrs is a versatile package written in TypeScript that supports ES modules, CommonJS, and UMD</strong>. It implements the Free Spaced Repetition Scheduler (FSRS) algorithm, enabling developers to integrate FSRS into their flashcard applications to ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7a6a1601185fd103\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.npmjs.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d6fdc29877ad815c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAbout | Open Spaced Repetition\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d6fdc29877ad815c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://open-spaced-repetition.github.io/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4aca4b6a7ce43bcd\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpen Spaced Repetition (OSR) is ... repetition algorithms. We are the creators of the Free Spaced Repetition Scheduler (FSRS), which is backed by academic literatures and experiments. <strong>FSRS has been implemented in various programming languages, including Javascript, Golang, Rust,</strong> ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4aca4b6a7ce43bcd\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"open-spaced-repetition.github.io\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"51ef3ec1159ee3dc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpen Spaced Repetition · GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"51ef3ec1159ee3dc\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8656606836328af5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWe are the creators of the Free Spaced Repetition Scheduler (FSRS), which is backed by academic literatures and experiments. <strong>FSRS has been implemented in various programming languages, including Javascript, Golang, Rust,</strong> ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8656606836328af5\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"github.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"FSRS spaced repetition algorithm implementation JavaScript","provider":"brave","count":5,"tookMs":1564,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"brave","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c66e69f3478690f3\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nGitHub - open-spaced-repetition/fsrs.js: A spaced repetition algorithm which overtakes Anki and catches up with SuperMemo.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c66e69f3478690f3\">>>","url":"https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/fsrs.js","description":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"55374571b28ea892\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nconst fsrsJs = require(&quot;fsrs.js&quot;) let fsrs = new fsrsJs.FSRS(); let card = new fsrsJs.Card(); let rating= fsrsJs.Rating; let state = fsrsJs.State; //Set algorithm parameters // fsrs.p.request_retention=0.9 // fsrs.p.maximum_interval=36500 // fsrs.p.w=[0.4, 0.6, 2.4, 5.8, 4.93, 0.94, 0.86, 0.01, 1.49, 0.14, 0.94, 2.18, 0.05, 0.34, 1.26, 0.29, 2.61] console.log(fsrs.p) let now = new Date(2022, 10, 29, 12, 30, 0, 0); let scheduling_cards = fsrs.repeat(card, now); console.log(scheduling_cards);\n<<<END_EXTERN