{"type":"message","id":"33cf9994","parentId":"b800c8d2","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:29:44.880Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，npm 包安装成功了。现在我需要创建完整的 FSRS 记忆系统，包含：\n\n1. `src/storage.js` - 卡片存储（使用 SQLite）\n2. `src/fsrs.js` - FSRS 算法封装\n3. `src/scheduler.js` - 调度器\n4. `service.js` - 服务守护进程（检测到期卡片并发送 Discord 提醒）\n5. 更新 `handler.js` - 消息处理\n6. 更新 `SKILL.md` - 文档\n\n让我开始创建这些文件。","thinkingSignature":"32740c14dcf28cd310a98ef0ff9bbf86bcc811d10180ee9b98d6b68f6d3dfa57"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_17y4df2e3ipz_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/src"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":5425,"output":152,"cacheRead":7794,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13371,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772105380849}}
