{"type":"message","id":"9c7a0a47","parentId":"e9471d06","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:32:19.587Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_i9v1v8wvtrri_1","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 5240 bytes to /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/scripts/handler.js"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772105539584}}
{"type":"message","id":"a0fcfd35","parentId":"9c7a0a47","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:32:42.123Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"现在我需要更新 SKILL.md 文档，添加服务守护模式的说明。","thinkingSignature":"77bad965fb3a48cf0f439ab98436b49184bd4b243e5b208e07096450071fa2e2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_trfv175pruky_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"---\nname: fsrs-memory\ndescription: FSRS 间隔重复记忆系统 - 在 Discord 中添加卡片、复习、查看统计，支持服务守护模式自动提醒\nversion: \"2.0.0\"\nmetadata:\n  openclaw:\n    requires:\n      bins:\n        - node\n      packages:\n        - fsrs.js\n        - better-sqlite3\nenv:\n  - name: DISCORD_CHANNEL_ID\n    description: Discord 频道 ID 用于复习提醒（默认: 1475722914904014958）\n  - name: CHECK_INTERVAL\n    description: 检查间隔（毫秒，默认 5 分钟）\nfiles:\n  read:\n    - <SKILL>/data/cards.db\n  write:\n    - <SKILL>/data/cards.db\n---\n\n# FSRS Memory - 间隔重复记忆系统 v2.0\n\n在 Discord 中管理你的记忆卡片，支持 FSRS 算法和服务守护自动提醒\n\n## 架构\n\n```\nfsrs-memory/\n├── SKILL.md           # 本文档\n├── README.md           # 使用说明\n├── handler.js          # Discord 消息处理（兼容旧版）\n├── service.js          # 服务守护进程（新增）\n├── package.json        # 依赖管理\n├── src/\n│   ├── storage.js      # SQLite 存储\n│   ├── fsrs.js         # FSRS 算法封装\n│   └── scheduler.js    # 复习调度器\n└── data/\n    └── cards.db        # 卡片数据库\n```\n\n## 功能\n\n### 🎯 FSRS 算法\n- 基于开源 [fsrs.js](https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/fsrs.js) 实现\n- 智能间隔重复，优于传统 SM-2 算法\n- 自动计算最优复习时间\n\n### 添加卡片\n解析消息，格式：`问题::答案` 或 `问题:答案`\n\n示例：\n- `什么是FSRS::间隔重复算法`\n- `Mandarin:普通话`\n- `添加 苹果::Apple`\n\n### 命令列表\n- `列表` 或 `list` - 查看所有卡片\n- `统计` 或 `stats` - 查看学习统计\n- `待复习` 或 `due` - 查看待复习卡片\n- `复习` 或 `review` - 开始复习流程\n- `删除 <ID>` - 删除卡片\n- `帮助` 或 `help` - 显示帮助\n\n### 复习流程\n1. 输入 `复习`\n2. 系统显示问题\n3. 回复 1-5 评分：\n   - 1 = 完全忘记 (Again)\n   - 2 = 记得困难 (Hard)\n   - 3 = 正常回忆 (Good)\n   - 4 = 容易回忆 (Easy)\n   - 5 = 瞬间记住 (Perfect)\n4. 系统自动安排下次复习时间\n\n### 🔔 服务守护模式（新增）\n\n不再使用 cron 定时提醒，而是作为长期运行的服务：\n\n**启动服务：**\n```bash\ncd /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory\nnode service.js\n```\n\n**环境变量：**\n- `DISCORD_CHANNEL_ID` - Discord 频道 ID（默认: 1475722914904014958）\n- `CHECK_INTERVAL` - 检查间隔毫秒数（默认: 5分钟 = 300000）\n\n**工作流程：**\n1. 服务每 5 分钟检查一次到期卡片\n2. 检测到新到期卡片时，自动发送 Discord 提醒\n3. 避免重复提醒（同一卡片只提醒一次）\n\n**在 OpenClaw 中运行服务：**\n```bash\n# 启动服务（后台运行）\nopenclaw exec --background -- workdir=/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory node service.js\n```\n\n## 处理流程\n\n1. **解析消息**\n   - 检查是否包含 `::` 或 `:`\n   - 检查是否为命令（列表/统计/复习等）\n\n2. **执行操作**\n   - 添加：调用 storage.addCard()\n   - 列表：调用 storage.getAllCards()\n   - 统计：调用 scheduler.getStats()\n   - 复习：调用 scheduler.getNextCard()\n\n3. **返回结果**\n   - 格式化输出\n   - 返回 Discord 消息\n\n## 依赖\n\n- `fsrs.js` - FSRS 算法实现\n- `better-sqlite3` - SQLite 数据库\n\n安装依赖：\n```bash\ncd /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory\nnpm install\n```\n\n## 示例对话\n\n用户: `添加 什么是API::应用程序接口`\n系统: ✅ 卡片已添加！ (ID: 6)\n\n用户: `列表`\n系统: 📚 共 6 张卡片...\n\n用户: `复习`\n系统: 📝 复习卡片 #2\n   问题: 什么是间隔重复\n   回复 1-5 评分...\n\n用户: `4`\n系统: 😊 Good | 下次复习: 4 天\n","path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":13979,"output":1075,"cacheRead":7794,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22848,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772105539587}}
