{"type":"message","id":"73e65a06","parentId":"c43b5219","timestamp":"2026-02-26T11:35:45.905Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"服务守护可以正常运行。现在让我更新 README.md，并确保 SKILL.md 是最新的，然后总结完成的工作。","thinkingSignature":"32298eb74c41d821776b3ab62662fc8be2a1f8ebebd3adea62f222cf04493f90"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_g0lt5m8ujf9b_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# FSRS Memory - 间隔重复记忆系统\n\n在 Discord 中管理你的记忆卡片，基于强大的 FSRS 算法。\n\n## 快速开始\n\n### 1. 安装依赖\n```bash\ncd /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory\nnpm install\n```\n\n### 2. 启动服务守护（可选）\n```bash\n# 后台运行\nnode service.js &\n```\n\n### 3. 在 Discord 中使用\n\n**添加卡片：**\n- 直接发送: `问题::答案`\n- 或使用命令: `添加 问题::答案`\n\n**复习：**\n- 发送 `复习` 开始\n- 回复 1-5 评分\n\n## 命令列表\n\n| 命令 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `问题::答案` | 直接添加卡片 |\n| `添加 问题::答案` | 命令方式添加 |\n| `列表` / `list` | 查看所有卡片 |\n| `统计` / `stats` | 学习统计 |\n| `待复习` / `due` | 查看待复习 |\n| `复习` / `review` | 开始复习 |\n| `删除 <ID>` | 删除卡片 |\n| `帮助` / `help` | 显示帮助 |\n\n## 评分说明\n\n- **1** = 完全忘记 (Again)\n- **2** = 记得困难 (Hard)  \n- **3** = 正常回忆 (Good)\n- **4** = 容易回忆 (Easy)\n- **5** = 瞬间记住 (Perfect)\n\n## 服务守护模式\n\n启动 `service.js` 后，系统会：\n1. 每 5 分钟检查一次到期卡片\n2. 自动向 Discord 发送复习提醒\n3. 避免重复提醒相同卡片\n\n设置环境变量：\n```bash\nexport DISCORD_CHANNEL_ID=1475722914904014958\nexport CHECK_INTERVAL=300000  # 5分钟\nnode service.js\n```\n\n## 技术栈\n\n- [fsrs.js](https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/fsrs.js) - FSRS 算法实现\n- better-sqlite3 - SQLite 数据库\n- Node.js\n\n## 文件结构\n\n```\nfsrs-memory/\n├── SKILL.md           # 技能文档\n├── README.md          # 本文件\n├── handler.js         # Discord 消息处理\n├── service.js         # 服务守护进程\n├── package.json       # 依赖配置\n├── src/\n│   ├── storage.js     # 数据存储\n│   ├── fsrs.js        # FSRS 算法封装\n│   └── scheduler.js   # 复习调度\n└── data/\n    └── cards.db       # SQLite 数据库\n```\n","path":"/home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/README.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":25770,"output":607,"cacheRead":7794,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34171,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772105731549}}
